---
title: Mentors
description: "Meet the adult mentors who guide FIRST Robotics Competition Team 1102 in Aiken, SC."
permalink: /mentors/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Mentors</h1>
    <p>The adults who guide {{ site.team }} and the foundation that supports it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Our mentors</h2>
      <p>Adults who volunteer their time and expertise with the students.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="people">
      {% for p in leadership %}
      <li>
        <span class="initials" aria-hidden="true">{{ p.name | initials }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
          <p class="role">{{ p.role }}</p>
          {% if p.bio %}<p class="soft">{{ p.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--fog2 cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Want to mentor?</h2>
    <p>We are always looking for adults who want to help students learn.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.mentor }}">Email about mentoring</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
